GNU Radio CaribouLite receive source
==================================

The module exposes a native C++ receive source and optional Python/GRC bindings.
Its installed Python namespace is:

    from gnuradio import caribouLite

The module README (../README.md) describes the build, source parameters,
metadata output, examples and current validation limits. Doxygen generation is
controlled by ENABLE_DOXYGEN and requires Doxygen to be available at configure
time. No native GNU Radio transmit sink is implemented.
